                        "review": "A nice small strategy game with a mix of gathering resources and defense mechanics.\n\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1404768321\n5$ price tag fits perfectly for this game. It has a lack of content, but everything looks pretty and it plays funny.\n\nThere are 16 story missions plus ~7 side missions. Every mission has different objectives. To achieve these goals you need to construct buildings and gather resources every mission.\n\nEach building requires 1-time amount of minerals and consume some energy while being constructed. Defense buildings requires energy for attack. So, the main gameplay of the game is to find the perfect balance between resource gathering and consumption.\n\nBattle part of the game is simple too. You start with 1 tower and can unlock up to 7 new tower/buildings. Nothing exceptional, but it is a good addition to the main gameplay.\n\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1404768351\nPros\n- Easy to understand. Fun to play\n- Levels are trying to be different\n- Nice looking but minimalistic art\n- Nice sound and visual effects\n\nCons\n- Limited content. Just a few towers and enemies\n\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1404768336\n[h1]Resume[/h1]\nA nice strategy game with simple rules for a low price. Can recommend it for TD and strategy fans!",
